        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EQUIPMENT_TYPE to DEVICE is dashed: device_type stores the type &lt;i&gt;code&lt;/i&gt;, not a foreign key, so a scan recorded last year still reads correctly after a registrar renames the type. The code is validated against the table on write.&lt;br&gt;2. device_label and student_name on SCAN_EVENT intentionally duplicate the register. They are snapshotted at decision time so history survives a later rename or ownership transfer.&lt;br&gt;3. Staff foreign keys (registered_by, raised_by, resolved_by, issued_by) all reference APP_USER and are omitted for legibility." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="600" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
